aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, substituting ${a}_{1}=5$, $d=10$, and ${S}_{N}=845$ into the formula for the sum of an arithmetic series, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{N} & =\\frac{N}{2}(2{a}_{1}+(N-1)d) \\\\ 845 & =\\frac{N}{2}(2(5)+(N-1)(10)) \\\\ 845 & =\\frac{N}{2}(10+10N-10) \\\\ 845 & =\\frac{N}{2}(10N) \\\\ 845 & =5{N}^{2} \\\\ 169 & ={N}^{2} \\\\ N & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that we take the positive square root because $N$ can't be negative." 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341828 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341829 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341830 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341831 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341832 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1041 "selection" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341829 13194139535288 true] [17592186341827 1110 #uuid "d4cbdafe-2409-5673-ab98-4b1092a825ef" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341828 1034 "12" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341828 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535288 true] [17592186341828 1111 #uuid "9240e06a-7d70-5248-8811-05ff05fbd9af" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341829 1034 "13" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341829 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535288 true] [17592186341829 1111 #uuid "731babb2-0850-514b-ad98-3b1da9e6034c" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341830 1034 "19" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341830 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535288 true] [17592186341830 1111 #uuid "20aaa73f-6759-559c-9a8d-0f0bd74dc9ea" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341831 1034 "16" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341831 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535288 true] [17592186341831 1111 #uuid "900fa49a-d49a-5a1f-832e-33ea24132a2d" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341832 1034 "14" 13194139535288 true] [17592186341832 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535288 true] [175